    <h1>Five editions, five moments in the history of avant-garde film</h1>
    <p class="body-copy">EXPRMNTL took place just five times: in 1949, 1958, 1963, 1967 and 1974. Even so, each edition left an undeniable legacy for experimental cinema. From the beautiful posters designed by Pierre Alechinsky to programmes and photographs, in this section you can access digitised documents from each edition of the festival.</p>
